<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY WEATHER - WARM, SPORADIC STORMS - 25-30 C.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY WEATHER - WARM, SPORADIC STORMS - 25-30 C.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A warm, humid weekend, with clouds and sporadic showers and storms. Highs of 25 to 30 C on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
